1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,944
He said stop before the white line.
We're on it. Tell me that counts as

2
00:00:05,944 --> 00:00:06,340
before.

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:11,891
Jason, look where it ends. That's water
over there. The line is chalk, and

4
00:00:11,891 --> 00:00:13,080
it's washing away.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:18,631
He's waving the cash again. Maybe the
road just dips. We could leave the

6
00:00:18,631 --> 00:00:19,820
car and walk.

7
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:24,580
That fence post isn't floating toward
us. It's moving sideways. There's a

8
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,960
current where the road should be.

9
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:32,506
I can't see the edge anymore. Take my
sleeve. Forget the case, just tell

10
00:00:32,506 --> 00:00:34,090
me where to step.

11
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:39,643
Back toward my voice. One step. Good.
The case is gone. Leave it. Keep

12
00:00:39,643 --> 00:00:41,230
your eyes on me.

13
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:46,379
He's backing away too. He didn't know.
All that money, and neither side

14
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:48,360
could see the missing road.

15
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:54,727
Then we both got a warning in time. Keep
the car here. We'll wait for

16
00:00:54,727 --> 00:00:56,000
somebody who knows.
